================================================================================

System.Data.SQLite is an ADO.NET provider for SQLite maintained by the SQLite
Development Team.

Like the SQLite core it wraps, all of the deliverable code and documentation in
System.Data.SQLite has been dedicated to the public domain by the authors.
Anyone is free to copy, modify, publish, use, compile, sell, or distribute the
original code, either in source code form or as a compiled binary, for any
purpose, commercial or non-commercial, and by any means.

The authors disclaim copyright to the source code. In place of a legal notice,
here is a blessing:

    May you do good and not evil.
    May you find forgiveness for yourself and forgive others.
    May you share freely, never taking more than you give.
